---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import skyreach from '../assets/shots/skyreach.webp';
import crown from '../assets/game/crownIcon.png';
import shotgun from '../assets/game/w2.png';
import shield from '../assets/game/pk3.png';
---

<section id="features" class="section features" aria-labelledby="features-title">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head" data-reveal>
      <p class="kicker">Why it plays different</p>
      <h2 id="features-title" class="h2">Easy to pick up. <em>Hard to put down.</em></h2>
      <p class="lead">Every mechanic is built around the jetpack: speed, height and the risk of the acid below.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="bento">
      <article class="card spot jet" data-reveal>
        <Image src={skyreach} alt="A pilot hovering between floating islands on SKYREACH" widths={[480, 800, 1200]} sizes="(max-width: 760px) 100vw, 50vw" class="art" />
        <div class="copy">
          <span class="badge">Analog jetpack</span>
          <h3>Tap to hop. Hold to fly.</h3>
          <p>Ease off to hover and drift at one height. About three seconds of fuel, back to full a breath after you land.</p>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="card spot" data-reveal="2">
        <Image src={shotgun} alt="" width={192} height={60} class="icon wide" />
        <h3>Blast-jumping</h3>
        <p>Shotgun recoil and grenade blasts throw you across the map. Chain them with the jetpack to move fast.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="card spot" data-reveal="3">
        <Image src={crown} alt="" width={108} height={72} class="icon" />
        <h3>Bounties</h3>
        <p>Three kills in a row and you glow gold with a crown, worth +50 to whoever takes you down.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="card spot frenzy" data-reveal>
        <span class="pill">Final minute</span>
        <h3>Frenzy, then the acid rises</h3>
        <p>The last 60 seconds hit 1.5× harder and refuel twice as fast. In the last 30, the acid climbs. Get high or burn.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="card spot invite" data-reveal="2">
        <h3>One link, whole squad</h3>
        <p>Create a room and share the link. Friends tap it and land straight in your lobby, no codes to type.</p>
        <div class="link-ui" aria-hidden="true">
          <span class="url">thrustline-drab.vercel.app/?room=<b>KXQZ</b></span>
          <span class="copy-btn">Share</span>
        </div>
        <div class="avatars" aria-hidden="true">
          <i style="--c:#22d3ee">N</i><i style="--c:#f472b6">V</i><i style="--c:#7cff4f">K</i><i style="--c:#ffd54a">R</i><i style="--c:#3b82f6">+4</i>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="card spot" data-reveal="3">
        <svg class="glyph" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="4" y="6" width="16" height="12" rx="3" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" /><circle cx="9.5" cy="12" r="1.6" fill="currentColor" /><circle cx="14.5" cy="12" r="1.6" fill="currentColor" /><path d="M12 3v3M8 21h8" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" /></svg>
        <h3>CPU players</h3>
        <p>Three skill levels with human limits: reaction time, aim error, burst fire. They fill empty seats.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="card spot" data-reveal>
        <Image src={shield} alt="" width={96} height={96} class="icon pk" />
        <h3>Shields and airdrops</h3>
        <p>Shields soak damage before your health. A railgun parachutes in every minute; reach it first.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="card spot" data-reveal="2">
        <svg class="glyph" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 2.5 4 5.5v6c0 4.7 3.3 8.6 8 10 4.7-1.4 8-5.3 8-10v-6z" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linejoin="round" /><path d="m8.5 12 2.5 2.5 4.5-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" /></svg>
        <h3>Fair by design</h3>
        <p>The server referees every move and every hit. Impossible moves get snapped back and shots through cover never land.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="card spot phone" data-reveal>
        <svg class="glyph" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M13 2 4 14h7l-1 8 9-12h-7z" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linejoin="round" /></svg>
        <div>
          <h3>Smooth on budget phones</h3>
          <p>Graphics adjust to your device on their own, trading effects for frame rate when a phone needs it.</p>
        </div>
        <ul class="stats">
          <li><strong>&lt;1 MB</strong><span>Android app</span></li>
          <li><strong>~300 KB</strong><span>whole game download</span></li>
          <li><strong>Auto</strong><span>quality scaling</span></li>
        </ul>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<script>
  document.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('.spot').forEach((card) => {
    card.addEventListener('pointermove', (e) => {
      const r = card.getBoundingClientRect();
      card.style.setProperty('--mx', `${e.clientX - r.left}px`);
      card.style.setProperty('--my', `${e.clientY - r.top}px`);
    });
  });
</script>

<style>
  .bento { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(6, 1fr); gap: 18px; }
  .card { padding: 28px; transition: opacity 0.7s ease, transform 0.7s cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.7, 0.2, 1), border-color 0.25s; grid-column: span 2; }
  .card:hover { border-color: rgba(34, 211, 238, 0.4); }
  .spot::before {
    content: ''; position: absolute; inset: 0; pointer-events: none; opacity: 0; transition: opacity 0.3s;
    background: radial-gradient(420px circle at var(--mx, 50%) var(--my, 50%), rgba(34, 211, 238, 0.14), transparent 60%);
  }
  .spot:hover::before { opacity: 1; }
  h3 { margin-top: 18px; font: 400 23px/1.15 var(--display); }
  .card p { margin-top: 10px; color: var(--soft); font-size: 16px; }

  .card :global(.icon) { height: 44px; width: auto; filter: drop-shadow(0 6px 18px rgba(34, 211, 238, 0.25)); }
  .card :global(.icon.wide) { height: 34px; margin-top: 6px; }
  .card :global(.icon.pk) { height: 58px; margin: -6px 0 -6px -6px; }
  .glyph { width: 44px; height: 44px; color: var(--cyan); }

  .jet { grid-column: span 4; grid-row: span 2; min-height: 460px; padding: 0; display: flex; align-items: flex-end; }
  .jet :global(.art) { position: absolute; inset: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; object-position: 30% 40%; transition: transform 0.8s cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.7, 0.2, 1); }
  .jet:hover :global(.art) { transform: scale(1.04); }
  .jet::after { content: ''; position: absolute; inset: 0; background: linear-gradient(180deg, transparent 30%, rgba(5, 8, 15, 0.94) 92%); }
  .jet .copy { position: relative; z-index: 1; padding: 30px; max-width: 520px; }
  .jet h3 { font-size: clamp(28px, 3vw, 38px); margin-top: 14px; }
  .badge, .pill {
    display: inline-block; padding: 6px 10px; border-radius: 8px; font: 700 12px/1 var(--ui);
    letter-spacing: 0.16em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #041022; background: var(--cyan);
  }

  .frenzy { grid-column: span 2; background: linear-gradient(160deg, rgba(255, 77, 109, 0.22), rgba(10, 15, 34, 0.85) 55%), linear-gradient(0deg, rgba(124, 255, 79, 0.18), transparent 40%); }
  .frenzy .pill { background: var(--red); color: #fff; }
  .frenzy::after { content: ''; position: absolute; left: 0; right: 0; bottom: 0; height: 6px; background: var(--acid); box-shadow: 0 0 24px 6px rgba(124, 255, 79, 0.45); }

  .invite { grid-column: span 4; }
  .link-ui {
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 12px; margin-top: 22px; padding: 8px 8px 8px 16px;
    border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid var(--line-strong); background: rgba(5, 8, 15, 0.6); font: 600 15px/1.2 var(--ui); color: var(--soft);
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .url { white-space: nowrap; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; }
  .url b { color: var(--gold); }
  .copy-btn { flex: none; padding: 9px 14px; border-radius: 9px; background: var(--brand); color: #041022; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase; font-size: 13px; }
  .avatars { display: flex; margin-top: 18px; }
  .avatars i {
    display: grid; place-items: center; width: 40px; height: 40px; margin-right: -8px; border-radius: 50%;
    font: 700 15px/1 var(--ui); font-style: normal; color: #041022; background: var(--c); border: 3px solid var(--panel-solid);
  }

  .phone {
    grid-column: span 6; display: grid; grid-template-columns: auto 1fr auto; align-items: center; gap: 28px;
    background: linear-gradient(100deg, rgba(34, 211, 238, 0.1), rgba(10, 15, 34, 0.8) 45%, rgba(244, 114, 182, 0.08));
  }
  .phone h3 { margin-top: 0; }
  .stats { list-style: none; display: flex; gap: 30px; }
  .stats li { display: grid; gap: 4px; padding-left: 14px; border-left: 2px solid rgba(34, 211, 238, 0.45); }
  .stats strong { font: 400 26px/1 var(--display); }
  .stats span { font: 600 12px/1.2 var(--ui); letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--muted); }

  @media (max-width: 980px) {
    .bento { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); grid-auto-flow: dense; }
    .card, .frenzy { grid-column: span 1; }
    .jet, .invite, .phone { grid-column: span 2; }
    .jet { min-height: 400px; grid-row: auto; }
    .phone { grid-template-columns: auto 1fr; }
    .stats { grid-column: 1 / -1; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  }
  @media (max-width: 620px) {
    .bento { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .card, .jet, .invite, .frenzy, .phone { grid-column: auto; }
    .card { padding: 24px; }
    .phone { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 16px; }
  }
</style>
